# Real founding, the engine's own Zone.Activated(), and light read only after real rendered frames.
# The frames are real: `yield-frames` leaves the action opportunity unspent so the engine reaches
# XRLCore.PlayerTurn's own idle render loop. `advance` cannot serve here - it exists to keep the
# engine OUT of that loop, and two native runs proved a 2400-turn advance renders nothing at all.
# The unclaimed control is this same zone before the claim; no remote zone is thawed to look at it.
# Not ordinary play, not a night walk, and no claim-loss, option-toggle or cold-load coverage.
DESCRIPTION=a claimed zone carries one stamped light part and reports no cell below Light after real frames
REQUEST=founding-first-city
START=8.22@40,12
SCRIPT=stagedigest;claimed-light-setup;yield-frames 3;claimed-light-check;stagedigest
VERBS=claimed-light-setup,claimed-light-check
EXPECT=stagedigest:OK~founded=false,claimed-light-setup:OK~native-claimed-light phase=1,yield-frames:OK,claimed-light-check:OK~native-claimed-light cases=1 passed=1 failed=0,stagedigest:OK~founded=true,COMPLETE
SET=growth,native-regression
TIMEOUT=600
